{"version":1,"key":"article:55","content":{"id":55,"title":"Node.js之事件循环","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e16e995c-4315-4665-832e-e204a27bb83e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node.js 是单线程的，但是它却可以应用在高并发场景，原因就是它的事件循环机制。所以本篇文章来介绍 Node.js 的事件循环机制。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1116aab2-4838-42ca-b825-ab17870a2a33","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"同步与异步"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"094cb58c-92b7-455a-b8a2-20338bd03149","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为 Node.js 是单线程的，代码的执行不能使用同步机制，因为同步执行会阻塞代码，在单线程中阻塞代码意味着整个程序都被阻塞到了，从而无法处理其他任务。其他后端语言会使用多个线程去执行代码，即使一个线程被阻塞到了，其他的线程也不会有影响。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5cd7e020-9aeb-4cde-80eb-f3f84e086b48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 Node.js 使用异步的方式去执行代码，为了更好的理解异步的概念，我打个比方，假设你请我做一件事情，同步的方式就是你会一直等我将事情做完，在我把事情做完之前，你不能干别的事情；异步的方式就是你请我做一件事情，在我做事情的时候你可以干别的事，等到我将事情做完的时候我会去通知你。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"080477e7-d273-422c-a0f2-4174987acbb3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"以读取文件为例，我们来看同步的写法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"641b1aeb-2cd5-49a5-b793-9f7125125c8a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"98b65225-ef49-461f-bced-b623f548b9da","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const fs = require(\"fs\");\n\n// 程序会被阻塞在这里，知道文件读取完毕\nconst data = fs.readFileSync(\"./hello.txt\", \"utf-8\");\n\nconsole.log(data);\nconsole.log(\"同步读取\");","collabId":"91b4e8d8-1907-4928-87f8-695a322c3b5e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5a524e56-239f-4a88-9776-725718c4456b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出结果为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"b20fa8a8-846a-4162-90f1-a902415dad7d","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5ae7f4b4-806e-4b5a-9f5b-846ed54c416a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Hello World!\n同步读取","collabId":"56dbcfb1-7934-4236-bf1b-18ad930c1a1d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"423a2f61-9924-4eb1-82c7-2f1231bfca7b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为是同步读取文件，所以会程序会阻塞在这里，直到读取完文件才会继续执行代码，所以先输出读取的文件内容，然后输出 同步读取。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cc316f8f-fad5-444d-a94e-0e1c99a9e22a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着看异步的写法"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"85a1dadc-490a-4214-b61c-8fb7901d0895","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"77da70fe-240e-4171-a7b0-95ac7cabcbff","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const fs = require(\"fs\");\n\n// 程序不会被阻塞在这里\nfs.readFile(\"./hello.txt\", \"utf-8\", (err, data) => {\n  if (!err) {\n    console.log(data);\n  }\n});\n\nconsole.log(\"异步读取\");","collabId":"a30fdc64-5f68-4d4c-8e1d-0629601ac62e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"790aad92-736f-4e74-9712-d310d49c170e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出结果为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"0f21dba3-9533-42b7-baec-60145c5fbe6a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d410ad93-e42e-4708-9c29-273482e84a69","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"异步读取\nHello World!","collabId":"fe73b491-5c91-4a9b-84b7-3b3656779328","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ad2919b3-7787-4455-8f0d-91d3e7627c59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因为是异步读取文件，此时不会阻塞程序的执行，会继续执行代码，所以会先打印出 异步读取，等到文件读取完毕时，则会执行回调函数，打印出读取到的文件内容。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"a30a3df7-6b45-45a4-9103-66750b15bd76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事件队列"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"01533847-6c1e-45e1-bb54-7e67aefb5a20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面我们就来剖析 Node.js 异步执行的背后过程，我们知道 Node.js 是一门基于事件驱动的语言，我们监听某类事件，例如网络请求事件，并为它绑定一个回调函数，当事件发生时，则会调用这个回调函数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"59718807-bce2-457a-b8d5-ee2a14870c58","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事实上当事件发生时，回调函数并不会立即得到执行，而是会添加到一个队列中，而执行引擎则会不断的从队列中取出事件执行，取出事件执行的这个过程是同步的，就是说先添加进队列中的函数会被先执行，并且先执行完前面的函数才能执行后面的函数。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4f762452-056b-4f69-83fb-9e1189c39da8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们来看一个例子"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"ae56b550-5dc2-4e94-94d0-60ad848207ce","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d90a1741-a971-4bf7-96da-939595af66fb","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setTimeout(() => {\n  // 该回调函数会花费 100 ms\n  let end = Date.now();\n\n  while (end - start < 100) {\n    end = Date.now();\n  }\n}, 5);\n\nsetTimeout(() => {\n  let end = Date.now();\n  console.log(`延时了 ${end - start} ms 执行`); // 延时了 100 ms 执行\n}, 10);","collabId":"29f1037d-a070-4671-9e30-40b5c70aa731","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6053f507-06a8-4ef1-b784-83e4471d141b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们设置了两个定时器，一个延时 5ms 后执行，一个延时 10ms 后执行，但是我们发现第二个定时器是在延时 100ms 后执行的，并不是我们预期的那样。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d7159218-fd20-4d74-81cb-47a30b31052b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先我们需要明确一点，我们设置的 5ms 与 10ms 这些时间并不是指延时 5ms 或 10ms 后执行回调函数，而是指延时指定时间后将这些回调函数添加进事件队列。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8d41ff5e-3583-4739-bf1c-ee259c2d87e7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们来看一个时间线"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"2b8ccc09-29b0-4bee-8f94-f05dd794d803","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a170d585-fc01-418e-a5a6-5a7eaa852dd8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"98a67e60-4466-4d4a-892c-b7bec86bcc7e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"0ms 时，事件队列为空"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"49244216-1657-4c81-b85f-cb1a72ad51a4","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"25d68e47-7573-4c7f-ab05-7f812d696d90","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"5ms 时，第一个定时器时间到达，将回调函数添加进事件队列"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d36dea49-0ef1-4d21-9c49-2df8dbaa9773","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ebb58f99-7b0b-4566-a622-7c8e4b1ea7fe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"执行引擎检查事件队列，发现队列中有事件未执行，取出执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"42d77c87-9594-4071-be44-61f3c709962c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e52d5382-9b9a-4ee0-a430-a06e4f4b055c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"10ms 时，第二个定时器时间到达，将回调函数添加进事件队列，但是因为前面一个回调函数还在执行中，该回调函数不会执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9d89442b-5dbc-4c40-ad6a-ae8d8fa8c839","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c96bba1f-9d9b-4aaf-89a2-e2c0b58f05fd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"100ms 时，第一个回调函数执行完毕"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"07715121-88ae-4a95-8160-7498ab67052d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0e5759c7-18f7-4452-a55b-b174a3e87bb8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"执行引擎接着检查事件队列，发现队列不为空，取出第二个回调函数执行函数执行"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"2564b65d-fed2-4b45-a6c6-56a3d63e4a10","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddfb15fe-0d25-4163-9e30-36861f621dc7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以经过了 100ms，第二个定时器的回调函数才会被执行。"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"d7d38060-5524-4018-8c1b-3af47d99e395","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"事件循环"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f204ee9b-1284-4e51-872d-c9f7623a4eda","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"解决实际的问题，上面的模型想必已经够用了，但是如果要应对面试题，却还是需要更加深入的了解。首先看一个例子"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"7fdf47f9-129e-4737-aa7f-37bde28dbc18","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"30f21172-48a0-43ff-ac8b-8654d56dae8f","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(\"start\");\n\nconst start = Date.now();\n\nsetImmediate(() => {\n  console.log(\"setImmediate\");\n});\n\nsetTimeout(() => {\n  console.log(\"setTimeout\");\n}, 5);\n\nprocess.nextTick(() => {\n  console.log(\"nexTick\");\n});\n\nnew Promise((resolve) => {\n  console.log(\"resolve\");\n  resolve();\n}).then(() => {\n  console.log(\"then\");\n});\n\nlet end = Date.now();\nwhile (end - start < 5) {\n  end = Date.now();\n}\n\nconsole.log(\"end\");","collabId":"1b348225-4f9d-40a8-aadd-8189df2fda20","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b7373754-fa07-4347-bac2-b92829539806","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"请问上面程序的输出结果是什么? 我先卖个关子，希望你看完下面的内容之后能够回答出来。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dc8ccbc2-c4dd-4c05-8276-c95435934aba","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在上面我们使用一个队列来建模了程序的执行过程，事实上这个队列需要被拆分好几个队列"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"be15bcaf-52e9-4a11-b03d-913b5d09253a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"18ef09c0-d93d-4754-a208-84ca27c6a153","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"   ┌───────────────────────────┐\n┌─>│           timers          │\n│  └─────────────┬─────────────┘\n│  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐\n│  │     pending callbacks     │\n│  └─────────────┬─────────────┘\n│  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐\n│  │       idle, prepare       │\n│  └─────────────┬─────────────┘      ┌───────────────┐\n│  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐      │   incoming:   │\n│  │           poll            │<─────┤  connections, │\n│  └─────────────┬─────────────┘      │   data, etc.  │\n│  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐      └───────────────┘\n│  │           check           │\n│  └─────────────┬─────────────┘\n│  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐\n└──┤      close callbacks      │\n   └───────────────────────────┘","collabId":"e6e2e02d-7f02-45d8-956d-9a33710c47b0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"86ec6f3f-13fb-4a8b-85ff-c0bd9b32f0d1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面我们将队列拆分为了 6 个阶段，每一个阶段都有一个队列"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"77d3a3f2-74fc-43f1-8b3e-e10a773b12e9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d390b5bb-e504-4745-8ac6-e108d6eef5a3","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"49cd7061-f10e-46f6-adc7-87889b450a8b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"timers：setTimeout 以及 setInterval 中的回调函数会放入这个队列"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b60ec6c6-d00c-4031-8592-8948bfaf52dc","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4ac52836-36c8-4d20-983f-1eb75d1aeb98","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"pending callbacks：由于某些原因需要推迟到下一轮循环的 I/O 回调函数放在这个队列(目前我还没有遇到过此类事件)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"73ba2ac4-5f3e-4c80-8bd3-af33e4aaf6b7","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7b246393-3c1c-4e47-b7b8-d5ebbf02ed4b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"idle, prepare：这个队列是 Node.js 内部使用的，我们不需要关心"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"18bb66d7-59aa-47a2-9e03-12149e86d6c5","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5c8bbb45-4407-4029-92a3-64e9dfea5078","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"poll：I/O 事件，网络请求等事件会放在这个队列"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"8893ab11-a9fc-4731-912a-7de966a8b901","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7045d6be-d524-44a5-8270-afdeac22c679","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"check：setImmediate 中的回调函数会放在这个队列"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c2d8abc6-89a1-4a9c-9b25-c0d930794970","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f63d0ef0-2b40-43ee-9bfd-bb3d83991daa","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"close：与 close 相关方法会放在这个队列，例如 socket.on('close', callback)"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8926ae79-433c-4fce-8fa6-c3bc302b1121","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node 会依次经历这 6 个阶段，只有将某个阶段中队列的所有函数都执行完毕，才会进入到下一个阶段。但是关于 poll 阶段有一点不同之处，当进入 poll 阶段以后，它会计算 timers 定时器中下一个定时器到达的时间，然后检查 poll 队列是否有任务，如果有就执行，直到队列为空。当队列为空时"}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"997bb09e-b2b8-4043-98ee-9f92f6cdc6e6","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7ec127d5-1439-4930-a96e-79f2084e8432","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c902cd8-a484-43a7-9784-98c82566d906","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"是否已经到达了下一个定时器到达的时间，即 timers 队列中是否有任务，如果有则继续事件循环，来到下一个阶段"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"b4751990-86d9-434f-ae47-87fe1eca08ca","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"439ca20e-4ac2-4300-b05c-ae3070c6be4c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 timers 队列中没有任务，那么检查 check 队列是否有任务，如果有继续进行事件循环"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9e69ee17-c403-4c69-8edf-8cb2523a8a09","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"29b3cff2-1a2b-460b-9992-ee131e95eba3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果 timers 队列和 check 队列都没有任务，那么就会一个停留在 poll 阶段，等待新的任务到来，然后执行该任务"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8ad4f969-d00a-4df8-bdac-0aedf2110b77","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以会有很长一段时间都会处于 poll 阶段。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"b344eb3e-bd40-4046-812c-2101b6734b39","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a1520b46-4993-4943-998b-f67f180c65ab","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们把一次循环称为一个 tick。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1411528a-3cbc-4de1-a4f5-51be45ceade4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"不知道你有没有发现，我们并没有提及 process.nextTick 与 promise.then 中的回调函数放在哪个队列。其实还有两个队列，nextTickQueue 和 microTaskQueue，process.nextTick 中的回调函数会被放置在 nextTickQueue 中，而 promise.then 中的回调函数被被放置在 microTaskQueue 中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a7b188dc-9b93-40c2-82d1-c7e3527e8500","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"那么这两个队列在图中处于何种位置，其实在进入每个阶段之前，都会检查一遍这两个队列，如果有任务的话就会执行，直至将队列中的任务执行完毕。并且 nextTickQueue 队列中的函数比 microTaskQueue 队列中的函数先被执行。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8496f722-35e1-4612-9493-b767c6b92b10","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"明白上面的内容之后我们来看那道题目"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"d2a54873-77c2-4367-b50f-292bda132cf6","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5c4d77cd-127f-469e-904f-390f58458747","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"console.log(\"start\");\n\nconst start = Date.now();\n\nsetImmediate(() => {\n  console.log(\"setImmediate\");\n});\n\nsetTimeout(() => {\n  console.log(\"setTimeout\");\n}, 5);\n\nprocess.nextTick(() => {\n  console.log(\"nexTick\");\n});\n\nnew Promise((resolve) => {\n  console.log(\"resolve\");\n  resolve();\n}).then(() => {\n  console.log(\"then\");\n});\n\nlet end = Date.now();\nwhile (end - start < 5) {\n  end = Date.now();\n}\n\nconsole.log(\"end\");","collabId":"a21e7f26-8d69-4636-8b2b-f223b270a81e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"548cf644-0500-48f2-9553-257f29b9199f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先当我们开始运行程序的时候，并不会立即进入事件循环，而是首先将同步代码执行完毕，所以首先会依次打印出"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"6c34d0a0-c179-4063-9d3e-6a0a8593bd90","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"12ca1d30-a597-4326-b7ab-effaf5457892","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"start\nresolve\nend","collabId":"41c06fcf-f08b-4044-bfb0-a52e677ddfef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a79fe072-95b6-4957-a0c7-dbec09e6e193","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着在进入事件循环，因为在进入每个阶段之前都会先检查 nextTickQueue 和 microTaskQueue 这两个队列，并且 nextTickQueue 在 microTaskQueue 之前执行，所以接着打印出"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"f32dcbe9-79d2-4610-93cc-6c1bc2104058","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"27e2acf2-2fa7-4677-a883-53446edbfa4c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"nextTick\nthen","collabId":"cd207aab-ec3f-427d-82e6-a73281b98a39","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e64a63e4-718d-48c0-836b-8703b302d606","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着进入 timers 阶段，因为我们在主程序中有这么一段代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"56859daf-b40b-449d-bcf1-2fd93a5d05b3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"78132586-ccec-4275-98e7-ca7edd636f3c","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let end = Date.now();\nwhile (end - start < 5) {\n  end = Date.now();\n}","collabId":"d49aef1e-901e-4109-b71b-77a121e9960c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"286629db-2742-49c9-815a-6df7d2fccd79","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"目的就是确保 setTimeout 中的回调函数已进入 timers 队列，所以此时 timers 队列是有函数的，所以此时会打印出"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"bfa37c9e-60f1-49ae-aa05-6f26eb79f210","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3a131cf8-39c7-4f37-8564-924c13f6c600","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setTimeout","collabId":"ed0343f9-2933-4b38-b74f-3f747d3e4729","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4c072ea5-9936-4ebf-b1ac-bd281c27c51e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"接着进入 pending 阶段，该队列中没有函数；进入 poll 阶段(忽略 idle, prepare 阶段)，也没有函数，此时因为 check 队列中有函数，所以会从 poll 阶段进入到 check 阶段，所以接着会打印"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"b4f4b118-52db-406d-8629-2a98ceb9b489","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"44f58930-a604-419d-928d-b1a4198c9517","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setImmediate","collabId":"a849f859-25ca-4010-88f0-7adac03641d9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9c2daeb8-19f1-471b-9aa3-4575f78c5e06","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后进入 close 阶段，没有函数，回到 timers 阶段，以此往复。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"925f6c79-03ac-4045-9f6e-f02ca0f5b86b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面程序最终的打印结果为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"26018228-e057-460f-b750-a6199612e3f1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c27ae56c-78fd-4e25-b4f3-2754027c3def","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"start\nresolve\nend\nnexTick\nthen\nsetTimeout\nsetImmediate","collabId":"52a2ac93-dde1-48d4-90bf-35ca04083ab2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"6bd9ed89-ea02-492f-b0fd-42c32c6c1f48","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"setTimeout vs setImmediate"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"29430a98-bec5-425d-aa27-fae02d5faf85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"setTimeout 位于 timers 阶段，而 setImmediate 放置于 check 阶段"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"e9712e45-f931-43d1-9470-0e33d21841da","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"12cbe99f-23d3-48e7-b2ae-071d5ddf03b5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setTimeout(() => {\n  console.log(\"setTimeout\");\n});\n\nsetImmediate(() => {\n  console.log(\"setImmediate\");\n});","collabId":"11453814-489f-4ece-ba3e-51ba56579b38","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5009b130-3254-4d0e-a0c4-710bafaeb07a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以上面代码的执行结果应该是"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"4e196714-4de2-4836-9fab-b33b52e812fe","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ee688d32-65f1-4b4f-aa3a-a802228fe730","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setTimeout\nsetImmediate","collabId":"92e81246-6fde-4a1c-891a-7ec28acbd129","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"cdd5af75-472f-41d6-90ac-6e7d11e313ca","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是有时会打印出"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"9afd8820-97ee-4956-89b1-3aa8504d80e8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"48c95a85-fe2d-441f-9106-90f423ca8c87","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setImmediate\nsetTimeout","collabId":"ef66c6cf-af59-4297-9ef1-61102eadc9b7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2c627997-664d-4c3e-bb57-f2405a88478e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是因为 setTimeout 不传入时间时，默认是 0，而 Node.js 做不到 0ms 的定时，最少也是 1ms。如果执行主程序需要花费 1ms，那么 timers 队列中就会有函数，就会先打印 setTimeout，如果执行主程序不需要 1ms，那么来到 timers 阶段时，其中还没有函数，但是 check 队列中已经有函数了，就会先打印 setImmediate。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1ffab826-7195-495e-bd9d-11a19b47baf9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是如果在 I/O 回调函数中同时调用 setImmediate 和 setTimeout，那么会先执行 setImmediate，因为执行 I/O 回调函数时已经处于 poll 阶段，下一个阶段就是 check 阶段，所以会先执行 setImmediate"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"c42932e7-cccd-481c-b7c6-76ed1935b5cb","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fc2b557d-016f-4b5b-8311-a975f31aa516","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const fs = require(\"fs\");\n\nfs.readFile(\"./hello.txt\", (err, data) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    console.log(\"setTimeout\");\n  });\n  setImmediate(() => {\n    console.log(\"setImmediate\");\n  });\n});","collabId":"88e8ad4e-a0f9-4b7f-86a4-0a182291b895","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8623227-c795-4c43-ba03-1d2b0dd5d010","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"输出始终为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"af33a5ba-a7b1-4f59-8a58-f679f09fc101","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"65f3f32b-872a-4cd3-b276-9a0fcfd92a2e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setImmediate\nsetTimeout","collabId":"27c82edd-258f-41b1-be08-b14c2307a531","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"0d09161a-b2d0-4418-a2e7-0a7ab3a02aef","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"process.nextTick"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6dc89c81-bf45-4e78-9eac-d2f01b16ebf6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个函数的名字很有误导性，我们知道 process.nextTick 中的函数是在进入每个阶段之前执行的，所以它应该是 currentTick 而不是 nextTick。而 setImmediate 只有在 check 阶段才会执行，并没有那么的 Immediate。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f29cb59d-2552-4572-b519-f6231bf4b2c9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以有人提议将二者的名称调换。但是由于有太多的库依赖于这两个 API，如果改动 API 的话，会引起很多的改动。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7f60fd9e-cc80-4de7-851a-c7191a5bfb56","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外需要注意的一点是，如果我们递归调用 process.nextTick，那么 nextTickQueue 就永远不会空，即此时就会阻塞事件循环的运行"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"ecc9caff-5e55-4022-905d-ffc289fc834b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6a7e2fd0-f658-486e-8595-a2ec347fdf25","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"setTimeout(() => {\n  console.log(\"setTimeout\");\n});\n\nconst recursive = () => {\n  process.nextTick(recursive);\n};\n\nprocess.nextTick(recursive);","collabId":"cb105879-a3c2-47e4-a644-25d5a5df2a24","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac94c79b-faa3-41ae-98ed-f0f3468e259d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面 setTimeout 中的回调函数永远都不会得到执行。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"b6193797-03ca-4298-880e-fbbb31e552c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"9589b825-a2dd-4b9b-9f99-aa63056c12c5","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7570e023-4e43-478e-a0c8-872cb740a0c1","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"72ed1176-bf9d-4584-85e5-f558fda1c584","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://nodejs.org/en/docs/guides/event-loop-timers-and-nexttick/","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"e1287400-47a4-43e6-acf7-6bb43bda49a4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"The Node.js Event Loop, Timers, and process.nextTick()"}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6ece504d-7b00-44a5-a804-f61297ee33c8","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7287d898-3e1c-4204-8182-1df5d84662e0","children":[{"type":"link","url":"http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2018/02/node-event-loop.html","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"b4d2ffa8-374e-4c27-ad4f-7251f27ffbbe","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Node 定时器详解"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/C__Users_pc_.editor_resources_eugene-golovesov-SUvAYIkMm80-unsplash_9e6f86ff-e0f5-44be-962e-266d01972ef8_28b6b9a6-1f9a-40f1-8864-28773579bfe0.jpg","createTime":1614035483000,"updateTime":1756786713807},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1756786713807}}